<title>RUSSIA: Russia RTS share index ticks up 0.02 pct to record.</title>
<headline>Russia RTS share index ticks up 0.02 pct to record.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Trading System 24-share index ticked up 0.02 percent to 312.66 at the opening of trade on Wednesday from 312.60 at the close on Tuesday, the NAUFOR brokers association said.</p>
</text>
